      "rev_n_4_6e8882_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_6e8882_1",
        "node_id": "n_4_6e8882",
        "thought_text": "Re-evaluate the logic for calculating the minimum sum of debts. Ensure that the sorting and pairing of positive and negative balances correctly minimize the total debt sum. Consider edge cases where some balances might not have matching partners. Specifically, ensure that the algorithm handles cases where the number of positive and negative balances is unequal by pairing remaining balances appropriately.",
