        "node_id": "n_5_7d10c1",
        "thought_text": "Revised Thought-2: Instead of directly pushing the absolute values of balances into the heaps, push the actual balances. When popping from the heaps, calculate the absolute value of the popped elements to determine the amount to add to the total debt. This ensures that the correct amounts are used for both positive and negative balances. Additionally, ensure that any remaining balances after pairing are handled correctly to avoid undercounting the total debt.",
